 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-01-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The Maharaja has seen you in blood, not only in sand.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "madurai_troop",
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The King is pleased with the sand. He thinks you might be useful indoors as well.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I prefer the sky.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Preferences are luxuries. There is an estate that can house you and your officers. Padmini Amma's lands.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "She is Nair. Her house follows the old ways. They are... particular about who sleeps under their roof.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "You are Maratha? Which line?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Sawant. Kshatriya. My father's house has held the sword for five generations.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "We do not plough.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Good. That will satisfy the temple priests who cook at her house.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini Amma might tolerate a foreign captain, but she will not tolerate pollution.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Do not look for the sardar. Here the house does not belong to the man who sleeps in the front room.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "It belongs to the name on the mother's line. You will see.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM (small, under his breath)"
   ],
   "text": "Padmini Amma.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "IBRAHIM"
   ],
   "text": "Amma. This is the rider I spoke of. The one the sea and the Portuguese fought over.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The one who survived. The sea spits out strange things.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You understand me, Nagoji?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Enough to know when I am being insulted, Amma.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And enough to know when I am being measured.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Good. Men who cannot tell the difference do not live long here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Come. Leave the horses to the boys.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The king sends you here to be near his capital and his horse. Clever man.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He knows that understanding an estate is as important as understanding a charge.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am a soldier. I count men, hooves, distances.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "And who owns the land those hooves cross?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Who feeds the men you count? Whose pepper pays for their powder?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "My grandmother slept in that room. Her brother ran away with a dancer. Her sons went to fight for different chiefs.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "This house stayed with her sisters and their daughters.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The men come and go. The name stays here.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "In the Deccan we inherit through the father's line. A man's field is his son's.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "If your son's wife hates you, does that field still feel like safety?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Kalari. Our boys and some of our girls.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "When the king calls, they are ready. When the king forgets us, they are also ready.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The king has not yet decided whether you are a spear for his hand or a knife that might cut it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am still an experiment. He told me so himself.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He is honest, then. Good.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You have a family. Back in your hills.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Yes.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Parents. A younger brother. Some fields that do not know whether I am alive.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "And a wife?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "No.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Why not?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I rode where the Peshwa's orders sent me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I did not think it fair to ask a woman to wait for a man who might ride into Portuguese guns one morning and never ride back.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You assume she would wait.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Here, if a man does not return, the house continues. Perhaps your hills should learn from that.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You speak freely, Amma.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "I own this land. Why should I not?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You will hear a word here. *Sambandham.*",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "An equal bond. Not ownership. Not conquest.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "A woman stays in her own house. Her *tharavadu.* The man comes to her.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He does not own the house. He does not own the land. He does not own her.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And the children?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Belong to her line. The father is honoured. Loved, often.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-10-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "But he is a guest in the house where his children grow.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "It sounds... complicated.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "It sounds practical. A man who goes to war may not return.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "In your system, his wife and children are ruined. In ours, they are exactly where they were before.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "We do not pretend men are reliable, Sawant. We plan for their failures.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And if a woman wishes to leave? To follow her husband to his house?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-11-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Then she is a fool.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Your horses will graze in our fields. You will ride from this gate when the king calls.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "That makes you part of this house's story, whether you like it or not.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "grey_gelding",
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "And tell your men to stay away from the girls in the house.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "If they try anything, we will carve them from navel to feet. Do not test us on this.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Houses have long memories.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "And longer tongues.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "You will meet one of those tongues soon.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ibrahim",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "A princess of our Velinadu kin. Revathi Bayi.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "She has more opinions than I have pepper vines.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "If you truly want to understand this kingdom, listen to her as carefully as you listen to Ramayyan.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "She supports the king?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-12-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "She supports Travancore. Not always the same thing as supporting its current occupant.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "He allows her to speak against him?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "He allows what he cannot easily stop. The Velinadu line is old. Older than his throne.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "The old Eight Houses on the marches once thought themselves kings too, until he broke them.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-13-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "You outsiders see one crown. We see many, layered on the same land. Sometimes they sit well together. Sometimes they cut.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "When do we go to Velinadu?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "In two days. You will come as my guest, not as the king's experiment.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-01",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "That will confuse people. Confusion is useful.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Wash the salt from your skin.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-14-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "PADMINI"
   ],
   "text": "Then we will see whether you can speak to a princess without putting your Deccan boot in your mouth.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "padmini"
   ]
  }
 ]
}